Subject: [PATCH 00919/11171] [operator] add SOPS-encrypted Kaggle API token
 for ARC Prize 2026 ARC-AGI-3
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Operator joined the ARC Prize 2026 ARC-AGI-3 competition (Kaggle, $850k, deadline
2026-11-02, userHasEntered=True). Kaggle API token (KAGGLE_USERNAME/KAGGLE_KEY) encrypted
to secrets/kaggle.enc.yaml via the project age key, mirroring secrets/hf_token.enc.yaml.
The competition ships the ARC-AGI-3-Agents framework (agent plays games via the
three.arcprize.org API) — i.e. the exact live-games harness already validated this session
(Arcade SDK, 25 games incl. ls20, random-floor measured). Still needed: a registered
ARC_API_KEY (operator, from three.arcprize.org) for competition-scored agent play.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
